# StudyHub AI 📚

StudyHub AI is a mobile app that we created to make studying a little easier for university students.

The idea came from seeing how difficult it can be to keep track of lectures, assignments, study files, and deadlines when everything is in different places. We wanted to bring some of these things together into one simple app.

With StudyHub AI, users can manage their tasks, check their schedule, upload study material, view summaries, and use the chat feature to help with questions.

## What Ie Used

For this version of the project, ie used:

* React Native
* Expo
* JavaScript
* Expo Go
* GitHub



## What You Can Do in the App

The app currently has a few different sections:

* **Home** – Gives the user an overview of their study activities.
* **Files** – Shows study files uploaded by the user.
* **Tasks** – Allows users to view and manage their tasks.
* **Schedule** – Helps users keep track of their study schedule.
* **Chat** – Allows users to ask questions about their study material.
* **Profile** – Contains the user's profile section.

There are also onboarding and login screens when starting the app.

