## Our Goal

The main goal of StudyHub AI is to make university study management simpler.

Instead of students having to use different apps for their tasks, schedules, files, and study help, we want StudyHub AI to bring these features together in one place.

This project is something we are still working on, and we plan to keep improving it as we learn more about React Native, app development, and working with APIs.
